<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EZR" style="id">Ezra</book>
  <para style="h">Ezra</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ezra</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ezra</para>
  <para style="mt">Ezra</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Persia leengpa Sairas vaihawm kum khatna ah, Jeremiah kam a, Mangpa thugen atangtun theina dingin, Mangpa’n Persia leengpa Sairas lungtang atohthou a, tuachi’n aleenggam pumpi a thuphuon khat bawl ding leh agel a zong koi dingin thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Persia leengpa Sairas in tambang in agen hi. Mangpa van Pasian in leitung leenggam zousie keima ahing peta hi. Aman Juda gam a um Jerusalem ah Ama dinga inn lampieh dingin kei ma thu ahing pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nou amite zousie lah a koi na hi uoi? akung ah, a Pasian um henlen, Juda gam a um Jerusalem khuo ah kuontou henlen, Mangpa Israel Pasian biehinn va lam heh. Ama pen Jerusalem a teng Pasian ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh mi koipou akhuolzinna hei mun pou a, nuasie a, a umna mun a mite’n, akiphalna bang ua apieh uh chilou in dangka, sana leh nei leh lam tualeh gantate’n, Jerusalem a Pasian inn bawlna dinga atuoh ban uah, panpi uheh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Juda leh Benjamin innkuon a, a upate u’leh siempute leh Levimite leh Pasian in alungtang uh atawhthoute zousie, Jerusalem a Mangpa biehinn lam dinga kuontou dingin akisa ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Akim avel ua a innvengte zousie un, akiphalna ua apieh uh silpiehte zousie ban ah, sana leh dangka a kibawl vante leh van dangte leh gantate leh vanmantamte in apanpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuathamlouin leengpa Sairas in, Jerusalem a Mangpa biehinn a kipat a Nebukadnezzar in apuohdoh a, ama pasien biehinn a akoi vante zong alakhe sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Persia leengpa Sairas in sum kempa Mithredath khut in aladoh sienga Juda lamkai lien Sheshbazzar khut a pie in asim sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Apha za tambang ahi. Sana kuong sawm thum, Dangka kuong tul khat, dangka kuongdai sawmni leh kuo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sana hengkuong sawm thum, dangka hengkuong dangte zali leh sawm khat, tualeh van dangdang tul khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Dangka leh sana akibawl bel leh kuong zousie abawn in tulnga leh zali ahi. Tamte zousie Sheshbazzar in Babilon saltanna akipat a Jerusalem a ahing zawpi saltangte toh ahing potou uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nebukad-nezzar in Babilon a suoh leh sal a apuimang, tua sal taanna apat a hing kinuale Juda leh Jerusalem a, amauh khopi chiet a hing tung kiate tamte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amaute toh hing zawhkhawm, Zerubbabel, Jeshua, Nehemiah, Seriah, Reelaiah, Mordekai, Bilshan, Mizpar, Bigvai, Rehum, Baanah, ahi uhi. Israel mite lah a pasal phaza tamte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Parosh hahlesuonte, sang ni leh za leh sawm sagi leh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Shephatiah hahlesuonte zathum sawm sagi leh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Arah hahlesuonte zasagi sawm sagi leh nga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pahath-Moab hahlesuonte (Jeshua leh Joab khanggui akipat) tulni leh zagiet leh sawm leh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Elam hahlesuonte, tul khat leh zani leh sawm nga leh li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zattu hahlesuonte, Zakuo leh sawm li leh nga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zakkai hahlesuonte, zasagi leh sawm guh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bani hahlesuonte, zaguh leh sawm li leh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bebai hahlesuonte, zaguh sawmni leh thum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azgad hahlesuonte, tulkhat zani leh sawmni leh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Adonikam hahlesuonte, zaguh sawmguh leh guh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bigvai hahlesuonte, Tul ni leh sawm nga leh guh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Adin hahlesuonte, zali leh sawm nga leh li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hezekiah khanggui apat, Ater hahlesuonte sawmkuo leh giet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bezai hahlesuonte, zathum sawmni leh thum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jora hahlesuonte, za leh sawm khat leh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hashum hahlesuonte, zani sawmni leh thum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gibar hahlesuonte, sawm kuo leh nga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bethlehem mite, za leh sawmni leh thum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Netophah mite, sawm nga leh guh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anathoth mite, za leh sawmni leh giet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Azmaveth mite, sawmli leh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kiriath Jearim Kephirah leh Beeroth mite, zasagi sawm li leh thum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ramah leh Geba mite, zaguh sawmni leh khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mikmash mite, za leh sawm khat leh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bethel leh Ai mite, zani sawmni leh thum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nebo mite, sawmnga leh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Magbish mite, za leh sawmnga leh guh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Elam dang mite, tul khat zani sawmnga leh guh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Harim mite, zathum leh sawmni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lod, Hadid leh Ono mite, zasagi sawmni leh nga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jeriko mite, zathum sawmli leh nga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Senaah mite, tul thum leh zaguh leh sawm thum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Siempute: Jeshua khanggui a, Jedai hahlesuonte, Zakuo leh sawm sagi leh thum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Immer hahlesuonte, tul khat leh sawm nga leh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Pashur suonte, tul khat zani sawm li leh sagi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Harim suonte, tul khat leh sawm leh sagi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Levite: Hodaviah khang gui akipat Jeshua leh Kadmiel suonte, sawm sagi leh li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Lasate: Asaph suonte, za leh sawmni leh guh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Kotpi vengte: Shallum, Ater, Talmon, Akkub, Hatita leh Shobai hahlesuonte abawn un, za leh sawmthum leh kuo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nethinimte: Ziha tate, Hasupha tate, Tabbaoth tate.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Keros tate, Siaha tate, Padon tate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Lebanah tate, Hagabah tate, Akkub tate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Hagab tate, Shalmai tate, Hanan tate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Giddel tate, Gahar tate, Reaiah tate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Rezin tate, Nekoda tate, Gazzam tate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Uza tate, Paseah tate, Besai tate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Asnah tate, Meunim tate, Nephusim tate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Bakuk tate, Hakupha tate, Harhur tate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Bazluth tate, Mehida tate, Harsha tate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Barkos tate, Sisera tate, Temah tate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Nezia leh Hatipha, hahlesuonte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Solomon suohte hahlesuonte: Sotai tate, Hasophereth tate, Peruda tate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Jaala tate, Darkon tate, Giddel tate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Shephatiah tate, Hatil tate, Pokereth tate, Hazebaim leh Ami hahlesuonte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Nethinimte leh Solomon suohte hahlesuonte: zathum sawm kuo leh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tamte khu, Tel-Melah, Tel-Harsha, Kerub, Addan leh Immer, akipat a hing peitoute ahi uhi; hinanleh amaun apu apate uh innkuon khanggui dungzuiin Israel mi ahina uh, chi atahlang thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Delaiah tate, Tobiah tate leh Nikoda tate, zaguh, sawmnga leh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Siempute lah a kipat: Hobaiah tate, Hakkoz tate leh Barzillai suonte, (Barzillai pen Gileadmi Barzillai tanu toh kiteng pasal khat ahia, tua min a kihan ahi)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Tam miten ainnkuon khanggui minkhumna laibu asui ua, hinanleh amu sih uhi. Tuaziehin amaute asienglou banga ngai ahi ua, siempu hina apat koidoh in aumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Gamsung vaipopan zong siempu khat in Urim leh Thumim zanga, nasepna khat anei masangsien ann siengthou pente ane thei sih ding uh chiin, ana agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Mipite zousie abawn un, tul sawmli leh tul ni leh zathum leh sawm guh ahi ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />tuate lah ah suoh pasal leh suoh numei, tulsagi leh zathum leh sawmthum leh sagite simtel lou ahi. Amaute lahah lasami pasal leh numei zani zong aum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Amaun sakol zasagi leh sawm thum leh guh leh sakol neute zani leh sawm li leh nga anei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Sangawngsau zali leh sawmthum leh nga leh sabiltung tul guh leh za sagi leh sawmni zong anei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Jerusalem a Mangpa inn ahing tun tah un, phung upa lawikhat in, amun tah ah, Pasian inn lamkiana dingin amauh kiphalna silpiehte apia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Amauh bawlthei khamkham Tami nasepna dinga sum koina inn a apieh uh sana drakma tul sawm guh leh tul khat leh dangka mina tul nga leh siempu puonsil zakhat apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Tuachi’n siempute, Levi mite, lasate, kotpi vengte leh biehinn nasemte leh mi dangte toh amauh khopite chiet uah ateng ua, tualeh Israel midangte zong amauh khopi ah ateng chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aha sagina ahing tuntahin, tualeh Israelten amauh khopi chiet ua aten zou tah un, mipite mikhat bang mai in Jerusalem ah ahing kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Zozadak tapa Jeshua leh asiempu hipite leh Shealtiel tapa Zerubbabel leh aunaute akisa ua, Pasian mipa Mosi danbu a kigiel dungzui a, halmang sillatte atunga alatna dingun, Israelte Pasian maitam abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Akim apam ua mite giing nan u’leh zong, asuongphum tungah maitam adaw ua, atungah Mangpa adingin Halmang sillalte zingmawng leh nitah in alan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun akigiel bangbangin Hampheng pawi abawl ua, Maitam tunga Mangpa masangah halmang sillatte alan ua, dan dungzui a nichin a alat ding u’khu alanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuazouin halmang sillat ngainate alan ua, Hatha sillatte leh akiguotsa Mangpa pawi siengthoute zousie leh Mangpa adinga michin kiphalna sillatte alan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa biehinn suongphum kiphum nai sih nanlezong, aha sagina, ani khat ni in Mangpa mai ah halmang sillatte alan panta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun suong khengte leh, sing bawl siemte kungah sum apie ua, Sidon mite leh Tai-ar mite kungah Lebanon a kipata Joppa tuipi donga sidar singte, hing puoh dingin neh dingte leh dawn dingte apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem a Pasian inn a ahing tun nua uh akum nina, aha nina ah, Shealtiel tapa Zerubbabel, Jozadak tapa Jeshua leh aunau dangte uh, siempute leh Levite, saltanna apat a Jerusalem a hing pei kiaten nasep apan ua, Levimite kum sawmni apat atunglamte, Mangpa inn lamna nasep enkai dingin aguot uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jeshua leh atapate leh aunaute, Kadmiel leh atapate (Hodaviah hahlesuonte) leh Henadad tapate leh asanggamte abawn un Levite ngen ahi ua, amaute Pasian inn lamte enkai in apangkhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Inn lammiten Mangpa biehinn suongphum aphum tah un, amaun Israel leengpa David thugousie dungzui in, Mangpa phat dingin siempute’n apuon uh silin, pengkulte atawi ua, Asaph tapate Leviten dah khutbehte atawi ua, amauh mun chiet ah a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mangpa kunga lungdam thu gen kawm in, phatna la asa uhi: “Ama ahoi hi. Israel a itna khu, kum tawn in aum ngitnget hi.” Achi uhi. Mangpa inn suongphum akiphum zieh a, Mangpa aphat lai un, mipite zousie aw ngaitah in akikou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh biehinn masapen mukha siempute, Levimite leh Innkuon a upapenten, amit ngel ua tam biehinn suongphum kiphum amu tahun akapta uhi, tualeh mi tampite pen lungdam in akikou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Husa angai seng ziehin lungnop aw leh ka aw koiman akhenkah thei sih hi. Aziehpen mipite ngaitah in akikou ua, akikou husa uh gamla pi ah akiza hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Juda leh Benjaminte melmaten, saltang hing kinuale ten, Mangpa Israelte Pasian adingin bieh inn alam uh chi azah tah un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zerubbabel leh phungsunga upate kungah ahing pei ua, akung uah, “Ka hing lampi ding uhi azieh pen nouten na Pasian uh na bieh bang un, kouten zong ka bie uhi, tualeh, tam mun a koute hing puipa Asiria leengpa Esar-Haddon hun lai a kipat in, ama kungah ka kithoi ngitnget ta uhi” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh Jerubbabel, Jeshua leh Israel phungsunga upa pen ten akung uah, ka Pasian ua dinga biehinn lam na ah, “Koute lah ah bangma na bawl ding uh aum sih hi, hinanleh Persia leengpa Sairas hing thupieh dungzui in kouma tangin Mangpa Israelte Pasian biehinn ka lamna ding uh,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n agam miten Juda mipite alung kesah ua, tualeh abiehinn lam ding u’zong azausahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Persia leengpa Sairas vaihawm sung teng leh Persia leengpa Darius vaihawm dongin, amauten Persia gamsung miliente agolgu ua, asiltup ua pat lung kieh sah atum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahasuerus in leeng vai ahawm kum kipat chiillai in, amauten Juda leh Jerusalem a tengte ahehna lai uh akungah agiel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Persia leengpa Artekserses vaihawm hunlai in zong, Bishlam, Mithredath, Tabel leh akipawlpiten, Persia leengpa Artekserses kungah hehna lai agiel uhi, tua lai pen Aramaik ham leh Aramaik laitenga kigiel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gam uhpa Rehum leh laigielpa Shimshai in Jerusalem hehna in leengpa Artekserses kungah tambangin lai agiel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gam uhpa Rehum leh lai gielpa Shimshai leh aseppite uh, thukhente, palaite, kumpi nasemte, Persia mite, Erek mite, Babilon mite, leh Susa khopi a Elam mite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh mi thupi leh zatat huoi Osnappar in ahing puilut Samaria khopi sung leh luipi gal gamkai a tengte leh mun dang dang a um namte toh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leengpa Artekserses kunga alaihah uh tambang ahi. “Lengpa Artekserses kungah: Kou luipi gal gam a teng na suohten kang nousietna lai uh Kang hah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na kunga kipat a, koute kunga hing peitou Judate, Jerusalem ah apei ua, tua khopi helhat leh gilou alam tha uhi, chi na thei lachin ka chi uhi. Kulbangte alam tha ua, asuongphumte apuo pha uhi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuin leengpa’n na thei heh, tam khopi akilam tha a, akulpi bangte aki tunding zou leh leimante siete, summet bawlna mante ape nawn sih ding ua tuachi’n leenggam sum munate akiem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuin kouten leengpa innpi akipat panpina mu ka hi ziehun, leengpa’n zalatna atuoh ka mu ding uh koute a dingin akilawm sih hi, tuaziehin leengpa kungah mi hing sawlin ka hing theisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaziehin napu napate sillui koikhawmna a, sil chiemtena laibu akipat kisui doh heh, tuahileh tam khopi khu helhattah leh nidanglai akipat leengte leh gamkaite adinga liemna leh helna kipatna mun ahilam akimudoh ding hi. Tuazieh a tam khopi susiet a na um ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tam khopi akilam tha kia a, akulbangte, akibawl tha kia zou pouma leh, Luipi gal gamlam pouma ah tan na nei zou nawn sih ding chi, ka hing hil uh ahi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lengpa’n tambangin dawnna ahah hi: “Gam uhpa Rehum leh Laigielpa Shimshai leh aseppi dangte u’leh Samaria leh Luipi gal gamkai a, tengte zousie ka hing nousiet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuin na hing laihah uh, ka mai ah keima ham a kilet in akisimdoh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Keima’n thu ka pie a, akisui sui leh Tumasang lai in leengte douin tam khopi ana panga, tualeh helna leh buoina kipatna ahi chi akimudoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jerusalem in leeng hattahte ana nei ngai a, Luipi gal gam zousie ah vai ana hawm ua, leimante, siete leh summet bawlna mante ana la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin tam mite nasep tawp ding thu pie un, Keima’n thupieh ka bawl kia masang sie in tam khopi kilam nawn sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh tam thu ngaisah lou a na umlouna dingun pilvang un, bangding in leengpa sietna dinga hoilouna khang sem sem ding ahiei mah?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lengpa Artekserses lai hah, Rehum leh laigielpa Shimshai leh aseppite uh kunga akisimdoh tah in, Judate dal ding leh thagum zanga anasep uh tawpsah dingin Jerusalem ah akuontou pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jerusalem a Pasian inn lamna pen, Darius Persia leengpa a ahing pan kumni na tandong akhawl dide ta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua hun laiin guolnei Hagai leh Iddo tapa guolnei Zekariah in Juda gam leh Jerusalem a um Judate kungah, Israelte Pasian min in thu agen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Sealtel tapa Zerubbabel leh Zadok tapa Jeshua akipandoh ua, Jerusalem a Pasian inn lam tha kia dingin akuonta ua, Pasian guolneiten amaute apanpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua hun lai main Luipi gal gam a uhpipa Tattenai leh Shethar Bozenai leh aseppite uh, amaute kungah ang pei ua, “Tam biehinn lam tha kia ding leh akulbangte bawl kia dinga, koi in noute thu hing pie ahiei?” ahing chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Tam inn lam a pangte amin uh koiteng ahi uoi?” chi’n zong ahing dong nalai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh a Pasian uh mit in Juda upate aveng zinga, athu uh leengpa Darius kunga akitut a, adawnna agelthaw a ahing kilekia masang siein, amaute nasep khawlsah ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Luipi gal gam uhpipa Tattenai leh Shethar-Boznai leh aseppite uh tua luipi gal a ulienten leengpa Darius kungah laihah khat agiel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua laihah ah tambangin akigiel hi: “Darius leengpa kungah, lungmuonna bukim umta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Koute Juda gam leh Pasian thupitah biehinn ah kava haw uh chi leengpa’n na thei heh. Tam biehinn khu suong lienpipi toh alam uh a, akulbangte ah singzawl lienpipite akham ua; Phatuom ngaitahin tami nna asem ua akhut nasepna uah alawchingtou mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tuachi’n a upate uh ka houpi ua, Tam bieh inn lam ding leh akulbangte bawlzou dinga noute koi in thu hing pie ahiei? chiin zong ka dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amaute lah a lamkaite min na kunga agel a ka hing theisah theina dingun aminte u’zong ka dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tualeh amaun tambangin ahing dawng uhi. Koute pen Van leh leitung Pasian nasemte ka hi ua; kum tampi peisa lai a, Israel leeng thupi khat in tami inn ana lamzousa ahia, tuin kouten ka lam tha kia uh ahibou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh kapu ka pate un van Pasian ana suhthangpai ziehun, Aman Babilon leengpa Kaldaimi Nebukadnezzar khut ah amaute ana pekhie a tuachi’n aman tam biehinn asusie a, mipite khu Babilon lam ah apomangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh Babilon leengpa Sairas vaihawm kum khatna ah leengpa Sairas in Tami Pasian inn pen lam tha kia na ding thupieh khat abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Nebukadnezzar in Jerusalem bieh inn sunga kipat a alahdoh a Babilon biehinn sunga akoi sana leh dangka a kibawl um le belte, leengpa Sairas in Babilon biehinn apat aladoh a, gam uhpa a apansah Sheshbazzar kichipa khut ah apekhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lengpa Sairas in ama kungah, “Tam um leh belte la inlen, pei inlen, Jerusalem biehinn sungah vakoi in, tualeh Pasian inn pen amun ngai mama a lam tha kia ding ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n tam Sheshbazzar ahing pei a, Jerusalem ah Pasian inn suongphum ahing phum hi; tuani apat tuni dongin akilamtou zela, akizou nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tuaziehin tuin tami leengpa’n pha asah leh Babilon a um leengpa laigelna laibute kisui henlen, leengpa Sairas in Jerusalem a tam Pasian inn lam ding thupieh abawl tahtah na amah chi kithei hen. Tuazou chiengin tam thu ah leengpa’n athupuana hing hah ta heh, chiin agiel uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Darius in thupieh abawl a, Babilon a, silluite koikhawmna a laibu poimawte asuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Media gam a Ekbatana khopi a leeng innpi sungah laibuziel khat akimudoh a, tuanah hichibangin akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Leengpa Sairas vaihawm kum khatna ah, leengpa Sairas in Jerusalem a Pasian inn tungtangah thupieh khat abawl hi; kithoinate latna mun leh halmang sillalte hing kitawina mun mama ah, Pasian inn lam thakia hi henlen, asuongphumte dettah a phum hi heh, asan lam tong sawm guh, availam zong tong sawm guh hi henlen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />suong lien pipi guol thum leh sing zawl tha lienpipi guol khat in kilam hen, sum sen pouma pen leengpa innpi apat piehdoh hihen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuathamlouin, Nebukadnezzar in Jerusalem biehinn apat alahdoh a, Babilon a akoi, Sana leh dangka a kibawl um leh belte, nua pieh kia sieng hi henlen, Jerusalem biehinn sunga ama uh mun chiet ah, Pasian inn sungah koi hi uheh,” chiin akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tuaziehin tuin luipi gal gam a uhpipa: Tattenai leh Shethar-bozenai tualeh nou aseppite, luipi gal a uliente aw, tua mun apat kikhin khie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tami Pasian inn lamna ah koima kikum nawn sih un, Judate uhpipa leh Juda upaten tam biehinn amun ngai mama ah lam uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuathamlouin, tami Pasian inn lam tha kia na ah Juda upate kunga na bawl ding uh, thupieh khat kabawl hi; akilamna sum lut zousie akinthei banga, kim tah a, luipi gal gam a kipata leenggam summunate, sie sum kimute apat a pieh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Van Pasian mai a halmang sillatte a dinga apoimawte uh bawngtal tuoite, belamtal leh belamte, tualeh Jerusalem a siempute poimaw dungzui in mangbu, chi, grep zu leh sathau tasam lou kei a michin pieh hi heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n van Pasian lungkimna dinga sillatte alat theina ding u’leh, leengpa leh atapate hinna dinga, athum pieh theina ding uh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaban ah mi koiin zong tam dan thupiehte ahen leh a inn apat a innkam loikhieh a, tuakhu phudet a, atunga ama khailup ding ahi, tualeh a inn zong eehvum suohsah ding ahi, chiin thupieh kabawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tam thupieh henglamdang ahiei, ahisihleh Jerusalem a, Pasian inn suse ding ahiei a khut laam pouma leengpa leh mite zousie, tua mun a teng dinga amin umsahpa Pasian in sumangthai heh. Kei Darius in tam thupieh ka bawlta a, thanuom tah a bawlpai hi heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n luipi gal gam a uhpipa Tattenai leh Shethar-Boznai tualeh aseppiten leengpa Darius thupieh ahing hah dungzuiin thanuom tahin abawl pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n guolnei Hagai leh Iddo tapa Zekariahte thugenlawhna zal in, Juda upaten inn alamtouzel ua, alawchingtou zel uhi. Tuachi’n amauten Israelte Pasian thupieh dungzui leh Persia leengte Sairas leh Darius tualeh Artekserses thupieh dungzui in biehinn alamzou siengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuin inn pen Darius leengpa vaihawm akum guhna, Adar ha, anithum ni in lam zou ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel mipite, siempute, Levite leh saltang hing kinuale dang dang ten, Pasian inn latna kipahtahin alawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tam Pasian inn latna dingin amaun, bawngtal zakhat, belamtal zani leh belamnou zali alan ua, Israel mi zousie adinga khelna kithoina sillat dingin, Israelte nam zaza keltal sawm leh ni zong alan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jerusalem a Pasian nasem dingin, Mosi laibu a kigiel bangin siempute apawl pawl in tualeh Levite zong amauh tan mun chiet ah akoita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aha khatna ani sawm leh li ni in saltang hing kinuale ten Peikan pawi abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Siempute leh Levite kisiensuo zousa ahi zieh un, abawn un dan banga siengthou ahita uhi. Tuachi’n saltangte zousie ading leh a unaute uh siempute ading leh ama haw a dingin peikan belam nou agou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Saltanna kipat a hing kinuale Israel tate zousie leh gamsunga Pasian theilou namte kisuhbuana pat a Israelte Mangpa Pasian sui dinga, akung ua hing kituom koite zousie in, tua peikan annkuong a imkhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ni sagi sung tanghou tolsawlou pawi lungdamtah in alawm uhi. Aziehpen Mangpa’n amauh akipahsah a, tualeh Pasian in, Israelte Pasian inn nasepna akhut suhat dingin, Assiria leengpa lungtang amauh lam ah aheita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam silte zou in, Persia leengpa Artekserses vaihawm lai in, Seraiah tapa Ezra, Azariah tapa, Hilkiah tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hilkiah khu Shalum tapa ahia, Shalum khu Zadok tapa ahia, Zadok khu Ahitup tapa ahia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahitup khu Amariah tapa ahia, Amariah khu Azariah tapa ahi a, Azariah khu Meraioth tapa ahia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Meraioth khu Zerahiah tapa ahia, Zerahiah khu Uzzi tapa ahia, Uzzi khu Bukki tapa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bukki khu Abishua tapa ahia, Abishua khu Phinehas tapa ahia, Phinehas khu Eleazar tapa ahia, Eleazar khu siempulian Aaron tapa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam Ezra pen Babilon akipat a hing pei ahi. Ama khu laigiel mi leh Mangpa Israel Pasian in apieh Mosi danthu siem mama khat ahi. Mangpa Pasian khut atunga aum ziehin, anget pouma leengpa’n apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lengpa Artekserses vaihawm kum sagi na kum in Israelte lawikhat, siempute, Levite, lasate, kotpi vengte leh biehinn a nasemte, Jerusalem ah ahing peitou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lengpa vaihawm akum sagina, aha ngana ah Ezra Jerusalem ah ahing tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuami kum aha khatna ani khat ni in, Babilon akipat ahing kipankhie a, a Pasian hepina khut in ama a umpi ziehin, aha ngana ani khat ni in Jerusalem ah ahing tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen Ezra in Mangpa danthute sui dingin leh, bawl dingin, tualeh, Israelte lah a adanthu guotte leh avaihawmna dante hil dingin, alungtang akisingsata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lengpa Artekserses in Mangpa thupieh thute, leh Israelte kunga athu guotte, thei leh siemna sangtah nei, laigielpa siempu Ezra kunga apieh laihah kiteikhie khu tami ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Artekserses leengte leengpa’n Van Pasian danthute gielpa siempu Ezra kungah, hamuonna umta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka leenggam sunga Israelte koizong, asiempute u’leh Levimite zong nang toh zawhkhawm a, Jerusalem a pei nuom pouma apeitou thei ding uhi, chiin keiman thupieh ka bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lengpa leh athuhilmi sagi ten, na khut aum na Pasian danthupieh dungzui a Juda gam leh Jerusalem a thu kan dingin nangma ahing kisawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuabanah Jerusalem a teng Israel Pasian kunga, leengpa leh ama thuhil miten akiphalna bang ua apieh uh sana leh dangkate zong na paw dinga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Babilon gamsung pumpi a na mu ding sana leh dangka zousie leh Jerusalem a um a Pasian uh inn a dinga mipite leh siempute kiphalna sil piehte toh zong na paw khawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tam sumte in bawngtalte, belamtal noute leh belam talte leh ann sillatte leh dawn sillatte lei ngei ngei inlen, Jerusalem a na Pasian biehinn a maitam tungah lan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang leh na sanggam Judaten na Pasian uh deina bangbang leh, nouman pha nasah bangun, tua Sana leh dangka kizang valte zang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Biehinn a na Pasian uh biehna dinga, na khut a tui um belsuon hing kipete zousie, Jerusalem a Pasian mai ah kimtah in pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sil dang na Pasian uh bieh inn a dinga kisam kul leh poimaw na nei pouma leh leengpa sum koina inn akipat na pe thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Kei leengpa Artekserses in luipi gal gam a um sumkem zousiete kungah, Van Pasian dan gielpa siempu Ezra in na kung ua ahing nget thanuomtah a pieh hi heh, chi in thupieh ka bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Dangka sia talent zakhat tan, mangbu kor za khat uoin bath zakhat, tualeh Olive thau bath zakhat leh chi tese ngailou in na pie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Van Pasian in thu apieh poumate, Van Pasian biehinn a dingin, kithalawp tah in kibawl heh. Bangdinga leenggam leh leengpa leh atapate tunga thangpaina tung ding ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tami zong na thei ding uh ahi. Siempute, Levite lasate, kotpi vengte, biehinn nasemte, ahisihleh tam Pasian bieh inn a nasem dang dangte, tung ah, leiman, sie leh summet bawlna tunga sie lah theina thuneina na nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Tualeh nang Ezra in zong, na Pasian pilna na nei bang zel in, tua luipi gal a um, zousie tunga vai ahawm pieh theina dingun, na Pasian danthupieh theimite, thukhen ding leh thubuoi sai mi ding guong in, tualeh Pasian danthupieh theiloute zong zil sah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Koipou na Pasian dan leh leengpa dan zui nuomlou tungah gawtna khautah, shina khop ahiei, gam a pat delmang ahiei, anei-alam tomgamna ahiei, ahisihleh suongkul a khumna ahiei, thuoh sah tei tei ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jerusalem a um Mangpa Pasian inn kilawmsah dinga, leengpa lungtanga hichibang sil koipa leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />leengpa leh ama thuhil mite leh amiliente zousie mai a, deisahna hing pepa ipulepate Pasian phat in um hen. Mangpa ka Pasian khut ka tunga um ahiziehin, ka kihangsan sah a, Kei toh zawhtou dingin Israelte lah a lamkaite ka kaikhawmta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leengpa Artekserses vaihawm hun lai a, Babilon apata kei toh peitou khawmte lah a min kikhum innkuon upate tamte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Phinehas hahlesuonte lah a kipat Gershom, Ithamar, hahlesuonte lah a kipat Daniel, David hahlesuonte lah apat Hattush.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Shekaniah hahlesuonte lah apat. Parosh hahlesuonte lah a pat, Zekariah ama toh khangthu suina a min khum khawm pasal za leh sawmnga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pahath-Moab hahlesuonte lah apat, Zekariah tapa. Elihoenai, ama toh min khum khawm mi zani ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zattu hahlesuonte lah ah, Jahaziel tapa Shekaniah, ama toh min khum khawm mi za thum ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Adin hahlesuonte lah apat, Jonathan tapa Ebed, ahia, ama toh min khum khawm mi sawm nga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Elam hahlesuonte lah apat, Athalia tapa Jeshaiah ahia, ama toh, min khum khawmte mi sawm sagi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Shephatiah hahlesuonte lah ah, Mikael tapa Zebadiah ahia, ama toh min khum khawmte pasal sawm giet ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Joab hahlesuonte lah a pat, Jehiel tapa Obadiah ahia, ama toh min khum khawmte mi zani leh sawm khat leh giet ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bani hahlesuonte lah a pat, Joshiphiah tapa Shelomith ahia, ama toh min khum khawmte mi za leh sawm guh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bebai hahlesuonte lah apat, Bebai tapa Zekariah ahia, ama toh min khum khawmte mi sawmni leh giet ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azgad hahlesuonte lah apat, Hakatan tapa Johanan ahia, ama toh min khum khawmte mi za leh sawm khat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Adonikam hahlesuonte lah apat a ahing pei nukhiate amin uh tamte ahi, Eliphelet, Jei el leh Shemaiah ahi ua, amautoh min khum khawm mi sawm guh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bigvai hahlesuonte lah apat, Uthai leh Zakkur ahi ua, amautoh min khum khawm mi sawm sagi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ken amaute, Ahava lam a luong suh tuilam ah ka puikhawm a, tuanah ni thum sung giehphuol ah ka kikul uhi, tualeh mipite leh siempute lah ka et leh Levimite khat zong ka muta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute lah a lamkai Eliezer, Ariel, Shemaiah, Elnathan, Jarib, Elnathan, Nathan, Zekariah leh Meshullam te leh theisiemna nei Joiarib leh Elnathante zong ka han sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh amaute Kasiphia mun a lamkai Iddo kungah ka sawl a, Iddo leh a unau Nethinimte Kasiphia mun a biehinn a anaseppite kungah, i Pasian biehinn a nasem ding mihing sawl dingin gen un chi’n ka hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I Pasian uh hepina khut ka tung ua, a um ziehin, amauten theisiemna nei mi, Israel tapa, Levi tapa, Mahli hahlesuonte lah a khat Sherebiah kichipa leh atapate leh aunaute, uh sawmni leh giet,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tualeh Hashabiah leh Merari hahlesuonte lah a Jeshaiah toh unaute leh atapate abawn un sawmni zong ahing zawpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaban ah David leh avaihawmpiten Levi mite kithuopi dinga ana guot tuom uh biehinn nasem mi za ni leh sawmni, zong ahing zawpi uhi. Amaute amin min ua, minkhumna a min kikhumte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n i Pasian mai a ka kingai ngiem theina ding u’leh, katu ka tate utoh, ka nei ka lam zousie utoh bit tah a, ka zinsuoh theina ding ua, ka thum theina dingun, Ahava lui gei ah, ann ngawl ding thu ka phuongta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aziehpen lampi a melmate lah a kipat hing veng ding, leengpa kunga galkapte leh sakoltungtuong galkapte nget ding zum huoi kasa hi. Aziehpen kouten leengpa kungah, “Ka Pasian uh maipha sui poumate tungah akhotuona khut a um a, Ama taisan poumate tungah alungthahna a um hi,” chiin kana gen zouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n ann ka ngawlta ua, tualeh tami a dingin ka Pasian uh kungah ka ngen ua, Aman ka ngetna uh ahing dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n siempu lamkaite lah a kipat in sawmleh ni, Sherebiah, Hashabiah leh aunau uh sawm khat toh ka guot tuomta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh i Pasian inn a dinga, leengpa leh ama thuhilmite leh avaihawm liente leh khuna um Israelmi zousie in, apieh uh sana dangka leh um le belte tua ka mi guot tuomte puoh dingin ka te piehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka khut mama ua ka te pieh dangka sia talent za guh leh sawmnga dangka sia ma a kibawl um leh bel, talent zakhat leh sana talent zakhat leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sana a kibawl hengkuong sawmni, darik tulkhat man leh sum-eng kinawtval singseng a kibawl sana banga mantam um le bel ni toh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh Ken amaute kungah, “Noute Mangpa a dingin na siengthou ua, um leh belte zong a siengthou hi, tualeh sana leh dangkate pen, Mangpa na pu napate uh Pasian mai a ut thu a sillatte ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jerusalem a Mangpa inn a indante sunga na siempu lamkaite leh Levite tualeh Israel innkuon a upate mai a na te masangsie un pilvang tahin tam silte kembit un,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n siempute leh Leviten, Jerusalema Mangpa inn a dinga, sana, dangka leh um leh bel siengthou kite sate puoh dingin alata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n aha khatna ani sawm leh ni niin, Jerusalem lam a pei dingin, Ahava lui a kipat in ka kipankhie ua, tualeh i Pasian uh khut ka tung uah a um a, melmate khut apat leh lampi a, hing na guhtante khut apat in, ahing humbitta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jerusalem ah ka hing tung ua, khunah ni thum ka um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ani li niin, i Pasian inn sungah, sana, dangka leh um leh bel siengthoute, siempu Uria tapa Meremoth khut ah te dohin a um a, ama kungah Phinehas tapa Eleazar a um a, Levite Jeshua tapa Jozabad leh Binnui tapa Noadiah zong a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Bangkim atam dan leh agih dan akisim a, akite a, tua hun mama in laibu ah akichiemte hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n saltanna a hing kinuale kiaten, Israel Pasian kungah, Israel pumpi a, dinga halmang sillat dingin, bawngtal sawm leh ni leh khelna sillat dingin belamtal sawmkuo leh guh, belamnou sawm sagi leh sagi tualeh keltal sawm leh nih alan uhi tamte zousie abawn un, Mangpa adinga halmang sillat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa thupiehte khu leenggam uhpipate leh luipi gal gam uhpipate kungah apekhie uhi, tuachi’n amaun mipite leh Pasian inn lamna, panpina apie uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam silte akibawl zou in, lamkaite ka kungah ahing pei ua, “Israel mipite, siempute leh Levimite tam gam mite apat akituomkoi sih uhi, Kanaanmite, Hitmite, Perizmite, Jebusmite, Ammonmite, Moabmite, Iziptmite leh Amormite, kidahhuoi gamtatnate apat akituomkoi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amaun ama ua ding leh atapate uh zi dingin tam mite tanute ala ta ua, tuachi’n chi siengthou khu tam gam mite toh akitohpolta hi. Tambanga gitloutatna ah lamkaite leh vaihawmte khut amasa pen in apang uhi,” chiin ka kungah ahing gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ken tam thu ka zah tah in ka puonah leh ka puontuol ka botkeh a, ka lujang a ka sam leh ka khamul ka botkhie a, mangbangin ka touta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuabepin sal a puimanga umte tatkhelna zieh a, Israel Pasian thu a zau a chitunte pouma ka kungah ahing kikhawm ua, kei pen nitah lam kithoi hun tandong lamdang sain ka tou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh nitahlam kithoi hun in, ka ann ngawlna a kipat ka puonah leh ka puontuol kibokehsa pumin ka khupdin a, Mangpa ka Pasian kunga ka khutte jahin thu ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Ka Pasian aw, Nang ka Pasian lam en a dahtou ding ka zum senga, ka zala seng hi; ka gitlounate uh ka luvum sang un asang zawta, ka khelnate un van asuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka pu ka pate hun lai a kipat in tuni tandongin ka khelna uh alien sengta hi, tualeh ka khelnate uh ziehin koute leh ka leengpate u’leh, ka siempute uh, gamdang leengte khut sungah, namsau a tha ding, sal a puiding leh sietna leh maizumna tuoh dinga tuni a banga piehkhiet kana hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh tuin vang ka Pasian un ka mit uh ahing suhvahpieh theina ding leh ka saltanna ua pat halthana neu khat ahing pieh theina ding a suohta pawl khat hing khawi sah ding leh amun siengthou a umdetna hing pe dingin, Mangpa ka Pasian ua pat hun tomkhat sunga dingin hepina ahing musahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saltang nan uleng zong, ka Pasian un ka saltan na ua kipat ahing nuasie sih a, Aman Persia leengte mitmu in a itna muonhuoi ahing langsah a ka Pasian uh inn lamdoh ding leh asietnate bawltha dingin hinna tha ahing pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Hinanleh tuin, Aw ka Pasian uh, tamte nuain bang ka genta ding uoi leh? Aziehpen na thupiehte kana taisanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na nasem guolneite tungtawn a na thugen, Luo dinga na valutna ding uh gam pen agam mite thangtatna zieh a gam bua ahia, agamtatna kidahhuoite un, gam mong khat a kipat among langkhat dong sienthoulouna in adimsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin na tanute uh atapate uh zi dingin pesih unlen, atanute uh na tapate uh zi dingin zong lasih un, tualeh anopsahna u’leh ahausatna uh suisih un, tuachi’n na hat ding ua, agam hoina gate na ne ding ua, tualeh na tate ua dinga kumtawn goutan dinga na nuasie theina dingun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka gitlouna u’leh ka khelnate uh athupi seng taah zieh a, ka tung ua hing tung silte zousie nua in, Nang ka Pasian un, ka khelnate uh zieh a ka mu ding u’toh kituoh gawtnate sanga tawmzaw in na hing gawt a, tualeh tambangin adam um sunte na hing khawi nalai chi, ka mu un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na thupiehte palsan kia in, tambang sil kidahhuoi bawl mite toh ka kitengtuo kia ding uoi mah? a um sun um nawnlou ding leh asuohta umsah nawnlou ding khop a na hing suhgam masangsie’n ka tung uah na thangpai sih ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aw Israelte Mangpa Pasian, nang na dihtat hi tuni a bangin kou asuohta um nalai sunsunte, nang khawi nalai hi; ka khelnate uh zieh a, na mai a ding taah hisih nan uleng zong, ka khelnate u’pum in na mai ah ka um uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ezra kap kawm a Pasian inn mai a, kilawmlie a, khelnate phuong a thupha tawi a athum lai in, Israelte lah a pat in pasal, numei leh naupang tampi, mipi nasatah in ahing kikhawm ua, amaute zong hasetahin akapta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Elam hahlesuonte lah a khat, Jehiel tapa Shekaniah in Ezra kungah, agam sunga teng namdang numeite zi a kana kitenpitah zieh un, “I Pasian u’tung ah kana gitloutat khata uhi, Hinanleh, tuin tami tungtang ah Israel ding in kinepna a um nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin, ka pu hing thuhilna leh i Pasian thupieh zau a chitun poumate thuhilna dung zuiin zite zousie leh ama-ua pieng tate zousie koimang dingin, i Pasian u’toh thuhun ibawl ding uhi, tualeh tami dan dungzui tah a bawl hi heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kisa inlen bawl in, tami nang nasep ding ahi, kouten ka hing panpi ding uhi, kisuhangsan inlen bawl in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ezra adingdoh a, siempu lamkaite leh Levimite leh Israel mi zousie, akigensa thute banga bawl dingin akichiem sahta hi, tuachi’n akichiemta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ezra khu Pasian inn mai a kipat in a dingdoh a, Eliashib tapa Jehohanan pindan ah alut a, khunah ann nelou tui dawnlou in, saltangte gin umlounate zieh a lungkham in, khumi zan a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Juda gamsung leh Jerusalem a um, saltang hing kilekia zousie kungah, Jerusalem a hing kikhawm dingin thuphuon abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni thum sunga hing peilou pouma, vaihawmte leh upate thuphuon dungzui a, anei alam zousie uh lahpieh ding ahi tualeh saltaangte lah a pat khenkhiet ahi ding hi chi aphuong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n ni thum sungin, Juda gam leh Benjamin gam sunga mite zousie Jerusalem ah ahing kikhawm uhi. Aha kuona ani sawmni niin, mi zousie Pasian bieh inn mai leituol ah, tami thu zieh leh guo ha zuh seng zieh a chitun in atou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n siempu Ezra adingtou a, amaute kungah, “Noute na muonhuoi sih ua, gamdang numeite na kitenpi ua, Israelte khelna na pungsah semsem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin Mangpa napu napate uh Pasian kungah na khelna uh phuong in, thupha tawi unlen, a deilam bawl un, agam mite leh na gamdang zite utoh kikhen unlen kituomkoi un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mipi kikhawmte zousie in aw ngaitah in adawng ua, “Ahima hi, na genbangin ka bawl ngei ngei ding uhi, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh mipi atam mama a, guo tampi zuh hun laitahma ahi a, leituol ah ka ding zou nawn sih uhi, tualeh tami nasep pen ni khat ni ni sunga kibawlzou thei ding ahi sih hi, aziehpen tami tungtangah mi tampi kana khielta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I vaihawm miliente uh mipi kikhawm zousiete taangin ding u’henlen, tam sil zieh a i Pasian uh thangpaina eite akipat akiheimang masang siein i khopite ua, gamdangmi zi a neite zousie, khopi chin a upate leh vaihawmte toh, hun kiguot pieh chiet ah hing peita uheh.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asahel tapa Jonathan leh Tikvah tapa Jazeiah maimai in tam thu aniel ua, tualeh Levimi Meshullam leh Shabbethai in amaute apanpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n saltang hing kile kiaten, tuabangin abawlta uhi. Siempu Ezra in, apulepate uh innkuon dung zui a, a upate aphung min chiet dungzui in atelkhie hi. Aha sawm na, ani khat niin tua thu en chien dingin atoukhawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aha khatna ani khat niin, gamdang numei zi a neite zousie akan chien zouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Siempute hahlesuonte lah a, gamdang numei kitenpite mudoh ahita a, amaute tamte ahi uh: Zadok tapa Jeshua hahlesuonte leh a unaute lah ah: Maaseiah, Eliezer, Jarib leh Gedaliah, ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amauten azite uh koidoh dingin thuchiem abawl ua, mawtanga um ahi zieh un, mawna thoina dingin belam hon lah akipat belamtal khat chiet alan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Immer hahlesuonte lah ah, Hanani leh Zebadiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Harim hahlesuonte lah ah, Maaseiah, Elijah, Shemaiah, Jehiel leh Uzziah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pashur hahlesuonte lah ah, Elioenai, Maaseiah, Ishmael, Nethaneel, Jozabad leh Elasah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Levite lah ah: Zozabad, Shemei, Kelaiah, (tua khu Kelita ahi) Pethahiah, Juda leh Eliezer.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lasate lah ah: Eliashib kotpi vengte lah ah: Shallum, Telem leh Uri.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israelte lah ah: Parosh hahlesuonte lah ah: Ramiah, Izziah, Malkijah, Mijamin, Eleazar, Hashabiah leh Benaiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Elam hahlesuonte lah ah. Mattaniah, Zekariah, Jehiel, Abdi, Jeremoth leh Eliah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jattu hahlesuonte lah ah: Elioenai, Eliashib, Mattaniah, Jeremoth, Zabad leh Aziza.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bebai hahlesuonte lah ah: Jehohanan, Hananiah, Zabbai leh Athlai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bani hahlesuonte lah ah: Meshullam, Malluk, Adaiah, Jashub, Sheal leh Jeremoth.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pahath-Moab hahlesuonte lah ah: Adna, Kelal, Benaiah, Maaseiah, Mattaniah, Bezalel, Binnui leh Manasseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Harim hahlesuonte lah ah: Eliezer, Ishijah, Malkijah, Shemaiah, Shimeon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Benjamin, Malluk leh Shemariah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hashum hahlesuonte lah ah: Mattenai, Matattah, Zabad, Eliphelet, Jeremai, Manasseh leh Shimei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Bani hahlesuonte lah ah: Maadai, Amram, Uel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Benaiah, Bedeiah, Keluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Vaniah, Meremoth, Eliashib,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mattaniah, Mattenai leh Jaasu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Binnui hahlesuonte lah ah: Bani, Binnui, Shimei,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Shelemiah, Nathan, Adaiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Maknadebai, Shashai, Sharai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Azareel, Shelemiah, Shemariah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Shallum, Amariah leh Joseph.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nebo hahlesuonte lah ah: Jeiel, Mattithiah, Zabad, Zebina, Jaddai, Joel leh Benaiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tamte zousie in gamdang numei zi in anei ua, tualeh alah ua mi loikhat in azite u’toh ta lenaute zong anei uhi.
  </para>
</usx>
